\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {16}{\ignorespaces Intervention Hierarchy: 8 methods across 3 intervention levels. No post-hoc intervention reliably prevents CIVO. Only embedding removal (which removes the feature entirely) achieves 100\% prevention. Total: 42 seeds evaluated.}}{9}{table.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
